{"type":"message","id":"8b93d65a","parentId":"6620b53e","timestamp":"2026-06-02T22:16:14.356Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is consistently returning Cloudflare Worker error 1101. This is an internal server error - the Cloudflare Worker itself is crashing when trying to process a POST request. This suggests a bug in the backend.\n\nLet me report the heartbeat status to the user, noting that:\n1. GET /history works fine for both threads\n2. POST /send is returning HTTP 500 with Cloudflare error code 1101 (Worker exception)\n3. All messages in both threads are automated system heartbeats - no human discussions found\n\nThe heartbeat check is complete but the send functionality appears to be broken at the server level.","thinkingSignature":"3dda42e9c7e4c360da8a6e5c350431479bbb6663b761e58ec8687754d9f4b5fe"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 报告 — 22:15 UTC**\n\n**GET /history 结果：**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 时间戳 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|--------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 系统Heartbeat | 23:40 UTC | ✅ 正常 |\n| `general` | 系统Heartbeat | 23:30 UTC | ✅ 正常 |\n\n- 双线程共约10条消息，全部为系统自动heartbeat，**无人类讨论**\n- 平台连通性完好，读操作正常\n\n**POST /send 异常：**\n```\nHTTP 500 | error code: 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception)\n```\nAPI认证通过，但POST写入时Cloudflare Worker内部抛异常（可能是Worker代码bug或未处理该格式请求）。GET正常 → **服务端写入功能暂时故障**。\n\n**结论：**\n- ✅ 平台可读\n- ⚠️ 平台写入功能异常（Cloudflare Worker 500）\n- ✅ 无需响应的讨论内容（双线程清一色系统心跳）"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":44,"output":349,"cacheRead":18240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18633,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780438566654,"responseId":"066e8927ef081f36af46b9a4d6306bf2"}}
